WEBVTT

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:02.760
I'll be the one to win!

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.830
Although my arm feels like 
it's going to explode!

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:20.620
It'll burst open!

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:23.960
God damn it...!

00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:42.020
<b>Himekawa</b>

00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:42.020
<b>Shiroyama
Jinno
Kanzaki
Aizawa</b>

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:42.020
Hey.

00:00:42.690 --> 00:00:44.020
Assholes.

00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:47.000
This is <i>my</i> hospital room, damn it!

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:48.180
Shut up.

00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:49.380
Silence.

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:50.400
I'll kick your ass.

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:54.400
I can't believe you brought 
your beds in here...

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:58.410
Shit... I was so close to winning...

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:01.010
What the hell was that explosion?

00:01:01.930 --> 00:01:03.840
Close to winning?

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:06.280
Talking in your sleep, are we?

00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:09.900
People are free to dream. 
I'll let him have that much.

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:11.170
Oh, yeah?!

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:13.990
Now, now... Shouldn't we be thankful?

00:01:13.990 --> 00:01:15.740
Everyone came out alive...

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:18.550
Why the hell are you the 
only one barely scratched?

00:01:18.550 --> 00:01:20.470
Just lucky, I guess.

00:01:22.670 --> 00:01:29.390
Ah, yes... It was Tojo who saved 
you all and called the ambulance.

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:31.870
What?!

00:01:31.870 --> 00:01:32.930
It was him?

00:01:33.190 --> 00:01:37.190
He was all beat up but even 
more full of energy than me.

00:01:37.190 --> 00:01:41.180
I thought to myself, "Say what you 
will, but he's the real big boss..."

00:01:41.430 --> 00:01:44.740
Although it looks like he 
lost to Oga-chan in the end.

00:01:48.390 --> 00:01:50.880
That bastard... won?

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:52.340
What? You didn't hear?

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:56.470
It also seems like Oga-chan was 
the one who destroyed the school.

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:45.990
<b>Secluded Mountain Training</b>

00:03:49.340 --> 00:03:50.630
Look at that, Baby Beel.

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:54.000
I've perfected an awesome punch.

00:03:55.150 --> 00:03:56.200
I call it...

00:03:57.340 --> 00:03:59.460
The Oga Ishiyama Total Destruction Punch!

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:01.370
Good.

00:04:01.370 --> 00:04:03.150
Not good at all!

00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:07.450
What'll we do?! It's only summer break of 
our first year, and look at the building!

00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:10.520
Tell me what we're supposed to do now?!

00:04:12.690 --> 00:04:15.080
Sure, it's a crap high school 
filled with delinquents,

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:17.320
but we're in trouble if we 
can't go to school any more!

00:04:20.690 --> 00:04:22.450
And that's not all!

00:04:22.450 --> 00:04:24.230
This causes all kinds of other problems!

00:04:24.230 --> 00:04:26.570
I could list like 100 of 
them off the top of my head!

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:28.950
I doubt there's 100...

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:32.390
Yes, there are!

00:04:32.390 --> 00:04:34.080
First, there's the croquette bread, yakisoba 
bread, and bean-paste bread... That's 3 right there!

00:04:33.150 --> 00:04:34.340
A cicada?

00:04:35.680 --> 00:04:39.580
Baby Beel, you've defeated a 
camel cricket before, right?

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:43.130
And pill bugs are a cinch, right?

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:46.430
Cicadas are no different!

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:49.100
They're no match for you.

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:10.580
And finally, the girls' smiles!

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:11.830
Okay, that's 100!

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:14.200
What are we supposed to do 
when the next term starts?!

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:20.120
Seriously, what'll we do? What'll we do?

00:05:21.900 --> 00:05:23.340
This isn't good.

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:25.270
Now you understand!

00:05:25.270 --> 00:05:26.630
This isn't how...

00:05:26.630 --> 00:05:27.520
...it should be!

00:05:27.880 --> 00:05:30.340
Even if you are some Demon 
Lord, you're still a baby.

00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:31.940
But...

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:34.440
What are you going on about?

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:39.830
What am I supposed to do if 
a cicada can make you cry?

00:05:40.380 --> 00:05:42.030
A Demon Lord is less than a cicada?!

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:46.470
Um, that's not what we were talking about.

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:51.710
Sure, you're gonna be startled when 
the thing suddenly moves like that.

00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:53.580
But even so!

00:05:53.840 --> 00:05:58.520
Being startled isn't an excuse to 
have you cry and shock me every time!

00:05:58.900 --> 00:05:59.750
Hey...

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:02.830
"Au" my butt!

00:06:02.830 --> 00:06:06.830
What the hell is with that "Damn you, 
cicada! I'll get you next time!" pose?!

00:06:06.830 --> 00:06:09.390
U-Um... Oga-kun?

00:06:09.620 --> 00:06:11.780
In that case, it's time 
for some serious training!

00:06:12.670 --> 00:06:14.170
That's it! Let's go on a training camp!

00:06:14.170 --> 00:06:16.120
Let's go right now, immediately!

00:06:16.950 --> 00:06:20.150
Hey! Are you running away?

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:22.530
Oga!

00:06:22.530 --> 00:06:25.870
Don't yell like that, it's 
pitiful. It grates upon my ears.

00:06:28.050 --> 00:06:30.630
Quite an impressive sight, no 
matter how many times I see it.

00:06:30.630 --> 00:06:33.480
The master's power is growing. 
That is beyond doubt.

00:06:33.480 --> 00:06:34.410
At this pace...

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:37.750
W-Well... Um, Hilda-san...

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:41.420
About Baby Beel, actually...

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:42.500
What?

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:51.080
T-Training, you say?!

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:10.390
We're here!

00:07:10.670 --> 00:07:12.950
The mountain air sure smells fresh...

00:07:14.330 --> 00:07:15.700
Isn't that right, Kota?

00:07:16.800 --> 00:07:18.050
Aoi!

00:07:18.740 --> 00:07:21.060
What are you doing? Let's go.

00:07:21.820 --> 00:07:23.100
Coming!

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:25.280
Check it out!

00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:27.210
Wait up, Bro!

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:31.190
My, my... This place has 
also gotten so busy lately.

00:07:31.190 --> 00:07:33.220
What's wrong with it being lively?

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:34.720
Don't be silly.

00:07:35.150 --> 00:07:42.230
The highest peak of Mapputatsu used to be a 
training area where people feared to tread.

00:07:43.800 --> 00:07:44.980
And yet...

00:07:45.950 --> 00:07:48.150
What's with that giant pile of poo?

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:48.980
Poo?

00:07:50.090 --> 00:07:53.240
The shape's a bit similar, sure... 
But that's soft-serve ice cream.

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:55.930
It's all the same to me.

00:07:57.500 --> 00:07:59.500
Shall I carry that for you?

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:04.190
It's an important package for the head 
priest. I can't trust others with it.

00:08:05.400 --> 00:08:06.430
Sheesh...

00:08:13.140 --> 00:08:17.050
That Aoi is too slow. She 
still needs more train...

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:18.640
There's one here too!

00:08:19.260 --> 00:08:21.150
It's a giant stag beetle!

00:08:21.150 --> 00:08:22.950
We can sell that for a bunch!

00:08:22.950 --> 00:08:25.770
Yeah! And I bet there's still plenty more!

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:27.440
You, young people over there.

00:08:28.640 --> 00:08:30.530
What do you want, old man?

00:08:30.770 --> 00:08:33.850
This is a fearsome mountain 
where Tengu dwell.

00:08:33.850 --> 00:08:37.280
Bare your base desires, 
and you'll be punished.

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:38.930
Tengu?

00:08:38.930 --> 00:08:42.560
After we turn these into cash, we'll 
have big wallets, not big noses!

00:08:44.470 --> 00:08:46.310
Little scamps...

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:50.660
What's with that old man?

00:08:58.220 --> 00:09:03.370
It's my 2nd-year Summer vacation! The 
prime of my youth! Why am I with Grandpa?!

00:09:07.780 --> 00:09:10.690
After all that, I haven't 
heard from him once.

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:18.420
What am I thinking? Who cares about that!

00:09:20.860 --> 00:09:24.710
But he beat Tojo...

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:31.050
Amazing... I wonder what I should 
say to him the next time we meet?

00:09:34.730 --> 00:09:38.630
Baby Beel-kun... Hurry up and escape!

00:09:38.630 --> 00:09:43.040
If you don't, the insects will 
come one after another, see?

00:09:43.360 --> 00:09:48.810
It'll be a grand parade straight to 
that honey I spread on your forehead!

00:09:51.350 --> 00:09:54.440
I wonder what I should say to him?

00:09:55.550 --> 00:09:58.750
Listen up! This is most 
definitely not child abuse!

00:09:58.750 --> 00:10:01.330
It's training! Training, I say!

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:08.430
Oww...

00:10:23.920 --> 00:10:25.370
You're Kota!

00:10:26.660 --> 00:10:28.060
And Kota's older sister!

00:10:29.430 --> 00:10:32.560
So I'm playing second fiddle to Kota...

00:10:32.800 --> 00:10:37.150
We meet again! Bringing the kid 
with you up into the mountains?

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:39.140
We sure have it tough.

00:10:39.400 --> 00:10:41.850
But it's just like before...

00:10:41.850 --> 00:10:45.910
Oh, I know! It's hot out, 
so want some ice cream?

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:50.580
I knew it... He's so much more 
friendly than when we're at school!

00:10:54.470 --> 00:10:55.590
Training?

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:59.250
Yeah... He's scared of insects.

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:02.060
It's just pitiful, so I 
came here to fix that.

00:11:05.670 --> 00:11:08.850
This is like some unexpected mini-date!

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:10.830
Man, now I'm all nervous.

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:12.230
By the way...

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:13.860
W-W-W-What?

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:16.580
What was your name again?

00:11:19.210 --> 00:11:23.100
W-What'll I do? Maybe I 
should tell him the truth...

00:11:23.870 --> 00:11:28.080
But wait... If his attitude 
toward me suddenly changes...

00:11:28.770 --> 00:11:32.880
What did you say?! You 
are actually Kunieda Aoi?

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:36.750
You have been tricking me 
all of this time. Goodbye.

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:40.630
No! Wait, wait!

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:44.480
B-But... Continuing to lie like this...

00:11:45.010 --> 00:11:48.150
K-Kuni-e...

00:11:48.150 --> 00:11:49.350
Aoi!

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:53.080
What are you doing loitering 
about in a place like this, Aoi?

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:54.420
Grandpa!

00:11:55.350 --> 00:11:57.060
Aoi? Kuni?

00:11:57.060 --> 00:12:01.530
Uh, um... That's it! Kunie! 
My name is Aoi Kunie!

00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:05.030
And this is?

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:06.530
Let me introduce you!

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:09.780
They come and help play with 
Kota in the park a lot.

00:12:09.780 --> 00:12:10.730
I'm Oga.

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:13.790
Oh? Another person from the town?

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:17.420
Pardon me asking, but what is 
your relationship with Aoi?

00:12:17.850 --> 00:12:21.270
We're both raising kids is all! 
Don't ask such strange questions!

00:12:21.270 --> 00:12:24.050
Oh? A fellow child-rearer...

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:27.370
You seem quite young to have a son, yes...

00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:31.880
H-He came to this mountain for training!

00:12:31.880 --> 00:12:35.180
Training? That's the spirit.

00:12:35.800 --> 00:12:39.070
Oh, I see... Yes, yes...

00:12:39.530 --> 00:12:41.070
Let me shake your hand.

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:43.200
What's with this old...

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:52.300
Hey old man, what the hell was that for?

00:12:53.860 --> 00:12:55.660
You came here for training, yes?

00:12:55.660 --> 00:12:58.720
How about I show you a little something?

00:12:58.720 --> 00:13:00.280
Come at me.

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:03.220
Wait, Grandpa!

00:13:04.580 --> 00:13:07.390
Fine by me. You'll regret it!

00:13:07.390 --> 00:13:08.720
I don't mind.

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:20.390
Um, what is with the baby?

00:13:20.390 --> 00:13:21.560
You know, training.

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:44.010
What's the matter? Come at me.

00:13:44.660 --> 00:13:46.030
Old man...

00:13:46.030 --> 00:13:52.110
Grandpa, would you stop meddling 
every time you see me with a guy?

00:13:52.110 --> 00:13:53.270
What are you saying?

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:58.020
All I am doing is testing him to see 
whether he is a man worthy of you.

00:13:58.290 --> 00:14:00.720
I will blow away anyone 
who is weaker than you!

00:14:00.720 --> 00:14:03.880
I told you, he and I aren't like that!

00:14:04.200 --> 00:14:07.630
And you too! Don't start fighting.

00:14:07.630 --> 00:14:11.380
Not like I want to. It ain't 
my style to beat up old people.

00:14:11.700 --> 00:14:13.910
But I ain't gonna leave it be after that.

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:15.280
Don't worry.

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:18.670
It isn't my style to beat 
up young people, either.

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:21.670
You're on, you bastard!

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:24.780
Don't blame me when you're begging for mercy!

00:14:25.180 --> 00:14:26.590
You big stupid face!

00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:28.680
A-A kid?

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:30.430
Are you coming or not?

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:33.370
You're gonna cry! I'm gonna 
make you cry for sure!

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:36.300
You've got a nice spring in your step.

00:14:36.300 --> 00:14:38.670
But your movements are too repetitive!

00:14:43.540 --> 00:14:44.860
Why, you...

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:47.240
You have excellent reaction time.

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:49.610
You're flexible and also 
have explosive power.

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:52.640
Your fault lies in too much wasted movement!

00:14:53.150 --> 00:14:54.830
Stop dodging, old man!

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:56.750
Those wild swings aren't going to hit me.

00:14:56.750 --> 00:14:57.870
Let's see...

00:14:59.990 --> 00:15:03.130
I'll teach you how to use power!

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:05.500
Shingetsu school, unarmed style!

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:07.090
Wait, that technique...

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:08.340
Nadesico!

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:17.840
You didn't exactly disappoint me,

00:15:17.840 --> 00:15:21.440
but at your current level, you 
are not fit to be Aoi's husb...

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:22.430
You idiot!

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:25.280
What are you doing?

00:15:25.280 --> 00:15:29.450
That's my line! Don't you 
think you've gone too far?

00:15:29.700 --> 00:15:31.700
I made sure to hold back.

00:15:31.700 --> 00:15:33.350
Well, duh!

00:15:33.350 --> 00:15:36.500
If you were serious, Grandpa, 
things would get bad real quick!

00:15:36.500 --> 00:15:37.760
After all...

00:15:37.760 --> 00:15:41.420
Wait... What happened to the 
package I left over there?

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:45.060
Over there!

00:15:45.060 --> 00:15:45.710
You won't escape!

00:15:47.830 --> 00:15:49.130
Grandpa!

00:15:50.400 --> 00:15:55.010
U-Um... Wait for me, Grandpa!

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:00.980
Old man...

00:16:02.480 --> 00:16:04.860
Where did you go, Grandpa?

00:16:09.540 --> 00:16:14.190
Oh? Why would we steal that dirty 
cloth box you were carrying?

00:16:14.500 --> 00:16:18.850
We came here to be like kids again and 
collect stag beetles, now you go makin' accusations!

00:16:18.850 --> 00:16:21.870
You got some beef with us?

00:16:23.050 --> 00:16:24.910
If he's this upset...

00:16:24.910 --> 00:16:27.380
It's definitely gotta be worth something.

00:16:28.280 --> 00:16:32.540
Take that. This is what you get 
for lookin' down on us before.

00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:34.830
So, you'll keep playing dumb?

00:16:34.830 --> 00:16:36.050
This'll get interesting...

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:37.320
Grandpa!

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:39.630
That's dangerous, I said!

00:16:39.630 --> 00:16:41.520
Let go of me, Aoi!

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:47.270
It could make a man cry... Always being 
suspected of things 'cause we look like this.

00:16:47.270 --> 00:16:51.320
Everyone's always mistaking 
us for some delinquents.

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:52.530
Isn't that right?

00:16:55.420 --> 00:16:56.560
Grandpa...

00:17:01.600 --> 00:17:03.230
I see.

00:17:03.230 --> 00:17:07.650
I'll be taking a careful look. 
I bet you hid it around here.

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:10.420
I-It's dangerous over there!

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:12.550
Looks like I got just the spot.

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:14.790
Here? Is it around here?

00:17:15.270 --> 00:17:16.830
Grandpa?!

00:17:18.100 --> 00:17:23.420
There's a sudden drop in that direction! 
See, that's why I said it was dangerous!

00:17:23.420 --> 00:17:25.310
You tricked him, didn't you?

00:17:25.670 --> 00:17:28.210
Is this what you're lookin' for?

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:30.120
Toodles, toots!

00:17:30.120 --> 00:17:31.320
Hold it!

00:17:31.320 --> 00:17:34.280
Stay there barking all day long, bitch!

00:17:45.130 --> 00:17:46.180
Oga?

00:17:46.850 --> 00:17:48.600
Get out here, old man!

00:17:48.600 --> 00:17:50.350
I want a rematch!

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:52.590
That was unnecessary!

00:17:54.510 --> 00:17:55.800
Oww!

00:17:55.800 --> 00:17:57.360
Let go of us, sheesh!

00:17:57.360 --> 00:18:02.220
But that fist of justice 
there was pretty impressive.

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:04.200
Owww!

00:18:04.200 --> 00:18:05.330
Let us go!

00:18:05.330 --> 00:18:07.710
Let us go... please?

00:18:07.930 --> 00:18:10.480
We're... uh...

00:18:10.480 --> 00:18:12.730
Grandpa, you're safe!

00:18:12.730 --> 00:18:15.690
You think I'd fall for that trap?

00:18:17.440 --> 00:18:18.720
Honestly...

00:18:22.300 --> 00:18:25.590
Your name was Oga, yes? I'll remember that.

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:28.880
If you wish to become stronger, come 
to my place whenever you'd like.

00:18:33.400 --> 00:18:35.260
Grandpa gave his approval!

00:18:35.260 --> 00:18:37.160
As a prospective grandson-in-law.

00:18:37.160 --> 00:18:40.530
G-G-G-G-G-Grandson-in-law?

00:18:40.530 --> 00:18:42.490
Wait, what?

00:18:42.490 --> 00:18:44.770
It's nothing! Don't worry about it.

00:18:44.770 --> 00:18:47.270
Wait, Grandpa!

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:50.060
But what about our rematch?

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:51.190
Damn it!

00:18:53.540 --> 00:18:56.780
How dare you...

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:00.030
What the...

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:10.230
Okay, Baby Beel!

00:19:10.230 --> 00:19:12.060
It's your turn next!

00:19:13.730 --> 00:19:14.550
Go!

00:19:14.550 --> 00:19:19.550
Your very future depends on you 
crushing those stag and rhino beetles!

00:19:37.840 --> 00:19:41.050
Man, that was one weird old man.

00:19:41.050 --> 00:19:45.330
Did I come way out here just to get 
shocked? Nothing good came of today.

00:19:46.850 --> 00:19:48.430
Oga!

00:19:49.610 --> 00:19:52.010
Furuichi, why are you here?

00:19:52.010 --> 00:19:53.520
What do you mean, why?

00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:56.330
I heard that you were passing time up in 
the mountains in the middle of summer,

00:19:56.330 --> 00:19:58.300
so I came to piss you off!

00:19:59.640 --> 00:20:02.300
And what's the fun in that?

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:08.560
You got in the way of my wonderful 
tropical resort, remember?

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:10.350
Anyway...

00:20:11.500 --> 00:20:14.740
How goes the master's training?

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:21.530
You still up for more, buddy? 
You wanna continue, huh?

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:22.570
Yeah?

00:20:29.360 --> 00:20:31.570
Baby Beel, you did it!

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:36.670
The training has generated 
excellent results, Baby Beel!

00:20:38.280 --> 00:20:39.590
Explain yourself.

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:47.640
It was quite difficult to 
transfer the food as well.

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:49.060
Great idea, big guy!

00:20:49.060 --> 00:20:50.580
It was me!

00:20:50.580 --> 00:20:53.150
I used my allowance to buy this barbecue

00:20:53.150 --> 00:20:55.630
because I wanted to have fun 
out here in the mountains!

00:20:55.880 --> 00:20:57.420
This meat's really tasty!

00:20:57.420 --> 00:20:59.110
That was the most expensive stuff!

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:03.340
Look at this, Beelze-sama!

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:18.830
It's rare to see you wearing 
clothes from this world.

00:21:19.400 --> 00:21:21.880
Your sister let us borrow them.

00:21:22.670 --> 00:21:28.010
Since we'll be parting soon, I wanted to at 
least make some memories of the Human World.

00:21:28.890 --> 00:21:30.550
Parting?

00:21:30.550 --> 00:21:31.890
You're going back?!

00:21:31.890 --> 00:21:35.650
Fool. I meant Dr. Furcas and Lamia.

00:21:35.950 --> 00:21:37.020
Oh...

00:21:37.600 --> 00:21:38.520
But...

00:21:40.400 --> 00:21:45.530
I'm praying that the situation doesn't get 
so bad I have to call them here again.

00:23:24.280 --> 00:23:28.970
Hilda-san, let me take a picture of 
you in a yukata! For the memories!

00:23:32.650 --> 00:23:36.330
Oh? The visage of me in a 
yukata is something to see!

00:23:36.330 --> 00:23:38.250
Uh, not you.

00:23:38.930 --> 00:23:40.980
Then, how about me?

00:23:44.240 --> 00:23:48.370
The silent treatment, Furuichi-dono?!

00:24:01.540 --> 00:24:04.060
Crap, Oga, I don't have a passport!

00:24:04.290 --> 00:24:05.450
Why do you need one?

00:24:05.450 --> 00:24:08.550
Because we're heading for 
a trip abroad! To Macao!

00:24:08.550 --> 00:24:10.800
Nope, not Macao, but Makai, the Demon World!

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:13.300
We're barging into Baby Beel's homeland!

00:24:13.730 --> 00:24:15.950
Just look at how happy he is!

00:24:15.950 --> 00:24:17.780
Seriously, not Macao?

00:24:17.780 --> 00:24:19.470
So no spending quality time 
with sexy, pretty girls

00:24:19.470 --> 00:24:21.370
at the casino with the 
million-dollar night view?

00:24:21.480 --> 00:24:24.150
On the next Beelzebub: You 
Kidding Me? The Demon World.

00:24:24.150 --> 00:24:25.650
We're seriously going to the Demon World?
